sequenceDiagram
  participant M as Mastra Agent
  participant P as PAR ApprovalRequest owner
  participant A as Current approver
  participant G as Gateway EffectAttempt owner
  M->>P: native approval suspension + sealed proposal
  P->>A: exact approval subject
  A-->>P: allow / deny
  P->>P: revalidate eligibility, revocation, Release
  alt allowed
    P->>G: exact governed effect
    G-->>P: receipt / outcome unknown / failure
  else denied
    P-->>M: decline; effect count 0
  end

